From 2ea75dd01e573afaf19b504738e88d0ee0030e8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 18:30:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] Space pauses/resumes, and Settings opens over the
 running video

The player had no keyboard control at all: pausing meant hitting the Pause
button, and Settings was unreachable while a video was on screen (the menu
items were drawn enabled but did nothing, because the player view owns the
whole main window).

  * Space toggles pause/resume whenever the player is shown. It is ignored
    while a text field owns the keyboard (the settings window has a few) and
    after EOS, where there is nothing left to resume.
  * The menu bar's Settings entry now opens the settings page as a window
    floating over the player instead of switching tabs; playback keeps
    running behind it. Esc closes it (in fullscreen Esc still leaves
    fullscreen, where the window is not drawn). Search / My Lists stay behind
    the player and are now drawn disabled rather than looking clickable.
  * The IMTUBE_DEBUG geometry dump reports the settings window position plus
    paused= / settings= state, so the UI tests can drive both.
---
 README.md           |  11 +++--
 src/ui/ImTubeUI.cpp | 101 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 src/ui/ImTubeUI.h   |   6 +++
 3 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

